      </tbody>
    </table>
  </table-wrap>
  <p><bold>Table 1:</bold> Comparison of different methods implemented
  in <monospace>Pygraphon</monospace> with their corresponding class
  names and references.</p>
  <sec id="comparison-with-existing-implementations">
    <title>Comparison with existing implementations</title>
    <p><monospace>nethist</monospace> and
    <monospace>NetworkHistogram.jl</monospace> only implement the
    network histogram method.</p>
    <table-wrap>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th align="left"></th>
