<fn-group>
  <fn id="fn1">
    <label>1</label><p>the SBA algorithm
    (<xref alt="Airoldi et al., 2013" rid="ref-Airoldi2013" ref-type="bibr">Airoldi
    et al., 2013</xref>) is not implemented in
    <monospace>Pygraphon</monospace> yet as it is intended to be used
    with multiple graphs and not a single observed graph. We plan to
    implement it in the future.</p>
  </fn>
